sc:"Trigger Chrono Overdrive to decelerate hostile projectiles (at 100% charge)",ventShortDesc:"Purge core heat at 60%+ to release a radial knockback pulse",shop:"Hangar & Logistics",selectItems:"Quick-select upgrades, quick drafts, or Warp Gates (1 - 4)",buyItems:"Confirm purchase for selected modules or upgrades",refreshShop:"Reroll shop inventory (consumes Credits)",skipShop:"Close Hangar interface and resume sortie",hangarKeyDesc:"Open Ship Hardpoint Garage during intermission phases",pauseKeyDesc:"Toggle tactical pause or exit the current Armory screen",tips:"CORE TACTICAL DOCTRINE",tip1Title:"Phase Parry & Chrono Charge",tip2Title:"Weapon Thermal Management",tip3Title:"Priority Target Counterplay",tip4Title:"Safe Perimeter & Route Planning",tip1:"Trigger Phase Dash [SHIFT] on projectile impact to parry shots back with amplified damage and reset cooldown; close-range Graze maneuvering accelerates Chrono [F] charge.",tip2:"Sustained fire raises core weapon heat. Once temperature reaches 60% or above, execute Thermal Purge [R] to vent heat and repel nearby hostiles before weapon lockout.",tip3:"Shield-Bearer hulls mitigate frontal impacts significantly — flank behind their arc to deal full damage. Prioritize eliminating Medic units maintaining active repair tethers.",tip4:"Keep the fighter inside the Safe Perimeter Ring to prevent outer radiation hull decay, and select Warp Gates aligned with your current hull integrity and weapon loadout.",infoKicker:"SYSTEM DOSSIER // TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS",infoModalTitle:"PROJECT & SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE",infoBuildBadge:"WEBGL2 · 60HZ DETERMINISTIC",aboutGame:"Project Overview",gameDescription:"Space Shooter: Nebula Vanguard is a browser-based 2.5D/3D tactical space roguelite built with Three.js (WebGL2) and TypeScript. Pilots deploy with a baseline frame, mount modular weapon assemblies across 6 hull hardpoints, navigate 5 branching combat chambers, and engage 6 multi-form capital bosses.",metricSimLabel:"Fixed-Step Tick",met